OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment over stalled free
OL,4,Aparking plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses and shoppers have urged
OL,7,FBradford Council bosses to "get your
OL,8,Fact together" after plans to
OL,9,Freintroduce free parking were put on
OL,10,Fhold.
OL,12,FThe Reform UK administration had
OL,13,Fproposed giving drivers one free hour
OL,14,Fat council-owned car parks, alongside
OL,15,Ffree evening parking.
OL,17,FThe move would have largely reversed
OL,18,Fchanges made by the previous Labour
OL,19,Fadministration, which scrapped some
OL,20,Ffree and evening parking as part of
OL,21,Fcost-cutting measures introduced amid
OL,22,Fpressure on the council's finances.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
